  "how_to_read_the_counts": "two choices decide every count here and both are spelled out rather than defaulted. The row set is either all 3 populations or only the 2 disjoint ones, and the summary statistic is either net_vw_bps, weighted by notional, or net_ew_bps, weighted per fill. The headline claim uses all populations and the notional weighting. It does not depend on the first choice and it does depend on the second: the book mid has 0 positive cells by notional but 150 per fill, so any sentence about it has to name which",
